  {
    "id": "0ec72d85-974e-5ce9-a008-a412c658aa7d",
    "pack": "cheliax-infernal-inheritance",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:exploitative-wealth",
    "name": "Exploitative Wealth",
    "level": 5,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["contract", "invested", "magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "cheliax-infernal-inheritance"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hard work can earn some money, but truly grandiose wealth is built on the backs of others. Devils convince others to work for you, extracting value from them. You can "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "b03a543f-4d12-5c6b-a4f9-6afe141aa651"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " at the same time as you perform another downtime activity. Once per week, from any distance, the devil who holds your bargained contract can invoke a non-compete clause, imposing a –4 circumstance penalty to your checks to Earn Income for 1 week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Enforce Competition",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "two"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (concentrate, manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per day"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You call upon an antitrust provision in your contract. The contract casts paranoia (DC 19), and if the target has more allies within the spell's range than you, they take a –2 circumstance penalty to their Will save."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.QZENjzvPNlwHwEUv"
    },
    "data": {
