  {
    "id": "773fd9de-c22c-541d-91f1-3f58117c2ab3",
    "pack": "cheliax-infernal-inheritance",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:mark-of-the-torrent",
    "name": "Mark of the Torrent",
    "level": 5,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["invested", "magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "cheliax-infernal-inheritance"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Access",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You're a member of the Order of the Torrent."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The Order of the Torrent works to rescue kidnapped people, and their cobalt blue badge can often open doors that would otherwise be closed. When wearing this badge, you gain a +1 item bonus to Survival and Diplomacy checks to Track or Gather Information about a missing person."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Modus Operandi",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (concentrate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per day"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Requirements",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " A kidnapping occurred within 15 feet of your location, or you have some information about the target or perpetrators of a kidnapping"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You attempt to "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "3c873e49-a1c4-53b5-9694-66b860d94d43"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " about those who perpetrated the kidnapping, the information supernaturally surfacing in your mind. The GM determines what skill and DC to use for this check based on the level and nature of the perpetrators (usually a Society check at a standard DC for the perpetrator's level). In addition, if you fail to Recall Knowledge about the kidnapper (but don't critically fail), you eliminate one false lead about the kidnapper or how they abducted the target. For instance, you might determine that an incorporeal undead wasn't involved, though you gain no other information about what happened. The mark can't provide specific identifying information about the perpetrators, like their name or location."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.EZTY8ZC7pT5xJgxO"
    },
    "data": {
      "price": {
        "coins": {
          "gp": 135
        }
      },
      "bulk": "negligible",
      "activations": [
        {
          "slug": "modus-operandi",
          "name": "Modus Operandi",
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "day"
          }
        }
      ],
      "usage": {
        "type": "worn"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "e1c20c8a-2e6c-5596-b252-f7a74b6178d2",
    "pack": "cheliax-infernal-inheritance",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:pits-protection",
    "name": "Pit's Protection",
    "level": 15,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["contract", "invested", "magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "cheliax-infernal-inheritance"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You are protected from physical harm. You gain resistance 5 to non-magical physical damage (except silver). Once per day, at any distance, the devil who holds this bargained contract can invoke a punitive damages clause as a single action with the concentrate trait to deal fire damage to you equal to twice your level, ignoring resistances, and gain half that many Hit Points."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Reasonable Force",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "two"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (concentrate, manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per day"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You cite a right of self-defense article in your contract. The contract casts "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "e076f164-c21d-51dd-a29d-d21888bb7d71"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", and you can then Shove or Demoralize an adjacent creature."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.KtiaWESCPVwzazby"
    },
    "data": {
      "bulk": "negligible",
      "activations": [
        {
          "slug": "reasonable-force",
          "name": "Reasonable Force",
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "day"
          }
        }
      ],
      "usage": {
        "type": "held",
        "hands": "one"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "6317820a-62d0-556b-ad7d-3a24f58fbe9a",
    "pack": "cheliax-infernal-inheritance",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:sea-retrieval-line",
    "name": "Sea Retrieval Line",
    "level": 3,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "cheliax-infernal-inheritance"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This braided sea kelp rope writhes slowly when submerged in water."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Requirements",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The target is in water"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The sea retrieval line uncoils and stretches through the water toward a target of your choice—an unattended, stationary object or willing creature of 10 Bulk or less. The end of the rope moves 20 feet when you Activate it and at the start of each of your turns, to a maximum length of 120 feet, until it reaches the target or runs out of length. Once it reaches the target, the vine pulls the unattended object or willing creature toward you, or pulls you toward the stationary object, at the same rate."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.cWY8zwWrPzHCZREq"
    },
    "data": {
      "price": {
        "coins": {
          "gp": 50
        }
      },
      "bulk": "light",
      "usage": {
        "type": "held",
        "hands": "one"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "f1c002e0-1aa9-5b7b-90d7-da7dda6343f8",
    "pack": "cheliax-infernal-inheritance",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:unholy-skill",
    "name": "Unholy Skill",
    "level": 5,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["contract", "invested", "magical", "teleportation"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "cheliax-infernal-inheritance"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Whether because of a lack of talent or a desire for fame, you've bargained for infernal aid. When you gain this contract, choose a skill. You gain a +2 item bonus to checks with that skill. Once per week, at any distance, the devil who holds your bargained contract can cite a royalties clause, taking from you the amount of currency you'd gain from Earning Income on an expert-rank task of your level. The currency teleports directly from your possessions to the devil's vaults. If you're unable to pay, the devil instead takes the item with a value higher than, but closest to, the amount you owe from your possessions as collateral, returning it when you pay the required amount."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Devil's Work",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (concentrate, magical, manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per hour"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You call upon your contract's apprenticeship clause. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your next skill action, and it gains the unholy trait."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.BHS27XtpW9icogkz"
    },
    "data": {
      "bulk": "negligible",
      "activations": [
        {
          "slug": "devils-work",
          "name": "Devil's Work",
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "hour"
          }
        }
      ],
      "usage": {
        "type": "held",
        "hands": "one"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1b4cbf4d-69ae-5ce7-933b-9b516469baba",
    "pack": "cheliax-infernal-inheritance",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:wind-up-widget-hand-powered-digger",
    "name": "Wind-Up Widget (Hand-Powered Digger)",
    "level": 5,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "cheliax-infernal-inheritance"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "These simple constructs are often created for children or as proof of concept for larger tools. Despite their resemblance to clockworks, wind-up widgets are animated by magic rather than complex internal mechanisms. They lack power sources, however, and must still be wound up before use."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "hand-powered digger",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " resembles a small handheld drill. Once activated and placed against a surface, at the start of each of your turns, it digs 15 feet in a straight line through dirt, sand, or another loose material (as a burrow Speed) or deals "
          },
          {
            "type": "damage",
            "instances": [
              {
                "formula": "5"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " damage to any harder or denser material, ignoring that material's Hardness if it's 4 or less. The digger leaves a tunnel 1 foot in diameter behind it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " 1 minute (manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per day"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You turn the widget's crank for 1 minute, and it comes to life. The widget operates autonomously—as described in its entry—for 10 minutes, then curls into a small metal ball until your next daily preparations."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.bAafH4oR9Lsp7qjk"
    },
    "data": {
      "price": {
        "coins": {
          "gp": 140
        }
      },
      "bulk": 1,
      "activations": [
        {
          "slug": "wind-up-widget-hand-powered-digger",
          "name": "Wind-Up Widget (Hand-Powered Digger)",
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "day"
          }
        }
      ],
      "usage": {
        "type": "held",
        "hands": "two"
      }
    }
  },
